@startuml state_diagram_command

skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam stateFontStyle bold

top to bottom direction

[*] --> ParsingOperation

ParsingOperation --> Calculating : operation valid
ParsingOperation --> ErrorShown : operation invalid

Calculating --> MemoryRecorded : success / record entry
Calculating --> MemoryRecorded : error / record error

MemoryRecorded --> ResultShown : show result
MemoryRecorded --> ErrorShown : show error

ResultShown --> [*]
ErrorShown --> [*]

@enduml